Cheetah Dual — notices for third-party and upstream material
============================================================

This repository contains original scripts, Android app source, Phosh lock-screen
CSS overrides, shared-partition tooling, and documentation authored by Abdalla Kamel Mohamed
El Afify, plus small derived adaptations of Omarchy Mobile build and
install helpers.

The project idea, the overall design and the combination of Ubuntu + Phosh on
the Pixel 7 Pro with Android side by side, two-way switch icons and a shared
partition are the original work of Abdalla Kamel Mohamed El Afify.

XDA Developers community (https://xdaforums.com/)
  Used as: tools and guides for Pixel 7 Pro flashing, A/B slots, AVB and boot
  images. No XDA files are redistributed here.

Omarchy Mobile (https://github.com/derekross/omarchy-mobile)
  License: MIT (see LICENSES/MIT-omarchy-mobile.txt)
  Used as: upstream pipeline reference for Pixel 7 Pro (cheetah) mainline kernel
  bring-up, initramfs layout, device package patterns, and slot-B flash allowlist.
  Files under boot/scripts/extract-vendor-firmware and ubuntu/build/alpine-fetch.py
  are taken from Omarchy Mobile tools/ with SPDX MIT notice retained where present.
  This project is NOT Omarchy Mobile. Omarchy Mobile ships Arch Linux ARM + Hyprland.
  Cheetah Dual ships Ubuntu 24.04 (noble) + Phosh.

